            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Additional documentation and metadata can be found in the file 'Data report.pdf'. “Dataset.sav”: Cleaned data file used in the analyses in SPSS format. Note that demographic data aside from age and gender were removed from the datafile to ensure anonymity. “materials.qsf”: This is a Qualtrics file that contains the materials used in the study to collect the data presented in \"dataset.sav\". Note that the HMT-S cannot be shared under a CC0 license. For information on how to access the HMT-S please visit https://www.fernuni-hagen.de/hot-project/. “analysis.txt”: This is the source code used to calculate the main analysis. Requires R statistics 4.10 with the package Lavaan 0.6-9 installed. “analysis.txt” contains the source code that was used to conduct the analyses on the data contained in “dataset.sav”; for sustainability and future accessibility reasons the file “materials.pdf”, which contains the above mentioned Qualtrics file in PDF format, was added to the data package."
          },
